# Public-data cache: the curated small *.dat samples ARE tracked (fetched by
# examples/fetch_public_data.py from SVO / ESO SkyCalc / CALSPEC). Raw FITS /
# VOTable downloads and temp files are not committed.
data/public_cache/*.fits
data/public_cache/*.vot
data/public_cache/_*tmp*
